msgid "1-MP global-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr "1MP global-shutter kleur + FLIR Lepton thermisch op één module."

msgid "1.8–5.5V battery input via a DC barrel jack."
msgstr "1,8–5,5V batterij-ingang via een DC-cilinderconnector."

msgid "10 Mb/s differential serial for industrial buses."
msgstr "10 Mb/s differentiële seriële verbinding voor industriële bussen."

msgid "10/100 Ethernet with Power-over-Ethernet."
msgstr "10/100 Ethernet met Power-over-Ethernet."

msgid "2.3\" SPI LCD with capacitive multi-touch and Qwiic."
msgstr "2,3″ SPI-LCD met capacitief multitouch en Qwiic."

msgid "5MP HDR sensor — high dynamic range for tough lighting."
msgstr ""
"5MP HDR-sensor — hoog dynamisch bereik voor moeilijke "
"verlichtingsomstandigheden."

msgid "5MP rolling-shutter colour + FLIR Lepton thermal on one module."
msgstr "5MP rolling-shutter kleur + FLIR Lepton thermisch op één module."

msgid "6µA standby motion trigger plus white and 850 nm IR."
msgstr "6µA stand-by bewegingsdetector plus wit en 850 nm infrarood."

msgid "8 Mb/s CAN-FD plus 1 Mb/s RS-232 in one shield."
msgstr "8 Mb/s CAN-FD plus 1 Mb/s RS-232 in één shield."

msgid ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> returns connected pixel regions matching one or more"
" LAB thresholds."
msgstr ""
"<code>find_blobs</code> retourneert aaneengesloten pixelgebieden die "
"overeenkomen met een of meer LAB-drempelwaarden."

msgid ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> draws all 21 joints and connections in "
"one call."
msgstr ""
"<code>ml.utils.draw_skeleton</code> tekent alle 21 gewrichten en "
"verbindingen in één aanroep."

msgid ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> filters tiny detections; "
"<code>merge=True</code> joins overlapping blobs."
msgstr ""
"<code>pixels_threshold</code> filtert kleine detecties; "
"<code>merge=True</code> voegt overlappende vlekken samen."

msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API-referentie"

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Boson / Boson+ — higher-resolution thermal."
msgstr "Adapter voor FLIR Boson / Boson+ — thermisch met hogere resolutie."

msgid "Adapter for FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermal cores."
msgstr "Adapter voor FLIR Lepton 1.x / 2.x / 3.x thermische kernen."

msgid ""
"Add-on boards that plug into the OpenMV Cam — networking, motor control, "
"displays, and more."
msgstr ""
"Add-onboards die op de OpenMV Cam worden aangesloten — netwerken, "
"motorbesturing, beeldschermen en meer."

msgid "Add-ons"
msgstr "Add-ons"

msgid "Alif Ensemble E3 — fusion-class Cortex-M55 with Ethos-U55 NPU."
msgstr "Alif Ensemble E3 — fusion-class Cortex-M55 met Ethos-U55 NPU."

msgid "AprilTag tracking"
msgstr "AprilTag-tracking"

msgid ""
"AprilTags are 2D fiducial markers — robust to motion blur and partial "
"occlusion, and they give you full 3D pose."
msgstr ""
"AprilTags zijn 2D-fiduciaire markeringen — robuust tegen bewegingsonscherpte"
" en gedeeltelijke occlusie, en ze geven volledige 3D-positiebepaling."

msgid "Async Bluetooth Low Energy — peripherals, advertising, and GATT."
msgstr "Asynchrone Bluetooth Low Energy — randapparatuur, adverteren en GATT."

msgid "Back to top"
msgstr "Naar boven"

msgid "Bar code detection"
msgstr "Streepjescodedetectie"

msgid "BlazeFace tracking"
msgstr "BlazeFace-tracking"

msgid "Boards"
msgstr "Boards"

msgid ""
"Bring your own YOLOv8 model trained on <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> and load it the same way."
msgstr ""
"Breng uw eigen YOLOv8-model getraind op <a "
"href=\"https://roboflow.com\">Roboflow</a> mee en laad het op dezelfde "
"manier."

msgid "Built-in detector — no model file or training needed."
msgstr "Ingebouwde detector — geen modelbestand of training nodig."

msgid ""
"Camera control: pixel formats, frame sizes, exposure, gain, and white "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Camerabeheer: pixelformaten, beeldformaten, belichting, versterking en "
"witbalans."

msgid "Camera modules"
msgstr "Cameramodules"

msgid ""
"Camera modules and sensor adapters that plug into the board-to-board "
"connector — colour, monochrome, thermal, and event-based vision."
msgstr ""
"Cameramodules en sensoradapters die worden aangesloten op de board-to-board-"
"connector — kleur, monochroom, thermisch en op gebeurtenissen gebaseerde "
"beeldverwerking."

msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Wijzigingslog"

msgid ""
"Click the socket-icon connect button in the IDE, then hit the green play "
"arrow to run your first script."
msgstr ""
"Klik op de verbindingsknop (stekker-icoon) in de IDE en druk vervolgens op "
"de groene afspeelpijl om uw eerste script uit te voeren."

msgid "Color tracking"
msgstr "Kleurtracking"

